	"data": "Cybernautics DAO — Governance & Reputation Architecture\n\nWhat It Is\n\nThe governance layer for Cybernautics: how a community of contributors makes decisions, earns influence, and prevents the concentration of power that plagues existing DAOs and crypto networks.\n\nThis document addresses a specific design problem: how to build meritocratic governance without it becoming a social credit dystopia.\n\nCore Principles (Non-Negotiable)\nGovernance power derives from contribution and reputation, NOT from…",
